{"id": "DfXPanotG4n", "title": "Video by toaidanh_", "description": "⚔️ THE WAR OF LANKA 🔥 - Ep2\n“The legendary Hanuman” is now available on Showrunner @showrunner.tv IOS app.\n\nAfter setting Lanka ablaze, Hanuman makes his daring escape across the ocean, defying countless obstacles before returning to rally the Vanara army for the battle ahead. ⚔️\n\nIn this version, I decided to keep Hanuman’s flaming tail burning throughout his journey instead of extinguishing it as in the original legend. I wanted that fiery aura to become part of his character. 🔥\n\nWhat do you think of this creative twist?\n\nThe legend continues… and the real battle is yet to begin. 👀\n\n#TheLegendaryHanuman #Hanuman #Ramayana #Lanka #IndianMythology #AIAnimation", "channel": "toaidanh_", "uploader_id": "46613229241", "uploader": "Danhtoai", "timestamp": 1793888888, "like_count": 9881, "comment_count": 71, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/149.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-2312989832830607a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 70.542, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr22-2.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQMVJ255EailbRzP-T3KUkex-JIR28EkurqwSj7vH8_8reWtSfabD1BoCktjp_mfksP15FPFpVD9eaLY4ix-RsDPemberP2FVLD7LGA.mp4?_nc_cat=108&_nc_oc=AdpovX_3IyLKC29H7o57nReGnO4NYeltE1BIRv2IOdmGnZXjL7pXxUTIiamVPb3C7Vtm7ujbgFWwyf-BmYKLrVN8&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr22-2.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=F8bx508dTfYQ7kNvwEdakok&&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=ZDDZ4VWWjC0jGZIXdNkR_g&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQSFyJ0gtD9qKS8qvC0S-YWgneNwrPdtloaMyWEjKae9Lg&oe=6AF438BD", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "prot